 class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111590/extras/71f591bb42e12d8149448055e57317e8.poster.avif?t=1681398050\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111590/extras/71f591bb42e12d8149448055e57317e8.webm?t=1681398050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111590/extras/71f591bb42e12d8149448055e57317e8.mp4?t=1681398050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Procedural map generation to make every run just a little different from the last.<br></li><li>4 Maps are planned to be released in the full version of the game.<br></li><li>20 Unique item modifiers that alter your gunplay.<br></li><li>90 Stackable passive upgrade items to infinitely scale your stats.<br></li><li>30 Playable breachers with their own playstyle and ability.<br></li><li>25 Permanent upgrades you can invest in your breacher for further progression.<br></li><li>60 Varied weapons in your arsenal. (pistols, smg's, shotgun, assault rifle, sniper rifle, throwers, repeaters and launchers)</li></ul>",
